,"shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"OSi2ColCxhS9oCoAUNbPig","review_id":"IQW8pc1j1qUKrSYaFiDqDA","date":"2015-05-01T19:46:19","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9522871375083923,"text_excerpt":"I finally made it to this New Orleans institution and I couldn't be more pleased with my experience. We went at around 1 and by then the lunch crowd had died down, so we were quickly seated. Everything on the menu looked so good and you can get an assortment of things like poboys, seafood platters and spaghetti. I decided to start with the turtle soup. While it wasn't bad, it's not on the level of a place like Commander's Palace. It had good flavor, but they kind of went easy on the turtle, if that makes any kind of sense. For my entree, I got the fried oyster platter and that came with fries. I LOVE fried oysters and any place that offers a fried oyster platter is good in my book. The oy..."},{"business_id":"OSi2ColCxhS9oCoAUNbPig","review_id":"RiRPFFuObPVtzRhbpjnOEg","date":"2018-07-15T15:11:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9451462030410767,"text_excerpt":"Recently re-obsessed with Mandina's. Like the city and well, all of us, it's had ups and downs through the years. But recent and frequent visits for both dinner and lunch have been outstanding. The Wednesday special of daube spaghetti is a revelation; think spaghetti and meatballs but instead of meatballs it's the tenderest imaginable chunks and slices of roast beef. The catfish meuniere rivals any of the fine dining places in the city with two huge, fresh filets. Sub the fries for mashed potatoes and you've got heaven. Good service, total NOLA atmosphere and parking!! Love me some Mandina's."},{"business_id":"OSi2ColCxhS9oCoAUNbPig","review_id":"zAPNbhS3FPB1Cvjp5J3j1g","date":"2019-07-10T22:16:37","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9440938234329224,"text_excerpt":"Love Mandina's! Went back to visit NOLA after being away for several years. Had Mandina's on my list and I am glad I did. I missed it! It was just I had remembered. We did have to wait a little bit for our table but it was well worth it. The atmosphere is so local and homey. Staff is so friendly. Guests are so friendly too. We started with the crab fingers.....garlic, butter, bread - all so good! Moved on to great italian and cajun specialties. Etoufee, eggplant Parmesan, chicken parm - all delicious and enough to feed a huge family and were only 5! Too full for dessert - I was so bummed! This is definitely a place for locals. Get ready for an experience at that local level and bring your..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"OSi2ColCxhS9oCoAUNbPig","photo_id":"Vpn9Gz_XZpDQIzFXEVEBnw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Vpn9Gz_XZpDQIzFXEVEBnw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8967335820198059},{"business_id":"OSi2ColCxhS9oCoAUNbPig","photo_id":"TWVDh2XXvMKbCFMfr4KGmw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/TWVDh2XXvMKbCFMfr4KGmw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.815594494342804},{"business_id":"OSi2ColCxhS9oCoAUNbPig","photo_id":"txFQakTn_FrFpFPXDb4zAw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/txFQakTn_FrFpFPXDb4zAw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7848796248435974},{"business_id":"OSi2ColCxhS9oCoAUNbPig","photo_id":"ViI7JN47R_8cb9KUAQpK6A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ViI7JN47R_8cb9KUAQpK6A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.780712366104126},{"business_id":"OSi2ColCxhS9oCoAUNbPig